The repo charges fee + slippage per SIDE. Half the round-trip
spread is the part a market order pays on each side, so compare the
'half' column against 'assumed'. Commission is on top of both and is
a published number: cTrader raw is about $6 round turn per lot,
which on a 100oz gold lot at $4,000 is 0.15bps round trip.

